Z||000005||Steven||03-15-2001||03:02 PM||||Are you possibly talking about a kit like the ones IRM used to sell? Now I say "used to" because there has been some question as to if they are still in business. They had a web site that showed their catalog, but you had to call them to order. The site was <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/Lane/1588/quickcat.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/Lane/1588/quickcat.html</A> <BR>Hope this helps.||||reg||1
Z||000006||rogergarrison||03-15-2001||06:02 PM||||no the IRM kit is a sports stock car, wide fenders etc. The GTP (Gran Touring Prototype) is completely different,  the windshield is almost airplane canopy shaped, very long tail. If you saw one youd never know it was even related to Fiero except for the sign at top of windshield. Give me a little while, ill post some of both for you Fiero racers.<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 03-15-2001).]||||reg||1
